# SIZE STYLE HEAD_D HEAD_H THREAD_D PITCH [ANGLE]
# One row for each size of a style, in the units of plicad(7): mm, or
# inches with in.  HEAD_D and HEAD_H are the diameter and the height of
# the head, at their largest; PITCH is the lead of one turn; ANGLE is the
# included angle of a flat head.  Nominal sizes of the standards named;
# a part keeps to the data of its maker.

